  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      203.45,
      401.89,
      251.99
    ],
    "text": "(h)to extend all forms of assistance to thedifferently- abled in developing their personalityand to implement all types of support programsrelevant to preschool/ early childhood education;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      179.85,
      265.49,
      401.91,
      326.39
    ],
    "text": "(i)to identify the health requirements of the people inrural and remote areas and to conduct medicalcamps and clinics in such areas and to supplymedicines to the needy through such camps andclinics;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      179.85,
      339.89,
      401.9,
      388.43
    ],
