    "text": "9.(1) The Corporation shall have its own fund and allmonies heretofore or hereafter to be received by way of gifts,testamentary dispositions, grants, donations or contributionsor fees on behalf of the Corporation shall be deposited to thecredit of the Fund of the Corporation in one or more banksas the Committee of Management may determine.",
