      157.15,
      358.97,
      397.19,
      394.31
    ],
    "text": "12. (1) The Corporation shall caust proper accounts tobe kept of its income and expenditure, assets and liabilitiesand all other transactions of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 8,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      406.97,
      397.24,
      430.31
    ],
    "text": "(2) The accounts of the Corporation shall be audited bya qualified auditor.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 8,
    "bbox": [
      169.15,
      442.97,
      363.45,
      454.31
    ],
    "text": "(3) In this section, \u201cqualified auditor\u201d means \u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 8,
    "bbox": [
