      466.97,
      397.17,
      526.31
    ],
    "text": "(a)an individual who being a member of the instituteof Chartered Accountants of Sri Lanka, or of anyother Institute established by law, possesses acertificate to practice as an Accountant issued bythe Council of such Institute; or",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
